      "writtenOn": "2023-01-04T23:08:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Look like we should start using `select \u003cBUS\u003e` to match the upstream pattern.  The rationale seems to be described here:\nhttps://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/commit/df81fef94483da9f2811d48088affbcfd61ab18c",
      "parentUuid": "3753f253_bed67a79",
      "range": {
