      "writtenOn": "2023-03-17T16:52:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the pattern you should use is to update  zephyr/drivers/cros_rtc/Kconfig and add a `select PLATFORM_EC_RTC` to the [`CROS_RTC_TYPE`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/zephyr/drivers/cros_rtc/Kconfig;l\u003d7)",
      "parentUuid": "d79d613c_b236d5e0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 570,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 573,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "c36b7af95bce1e9ca217153c49e1b1dc0d0f9a35",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
