      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-20T12:27:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "By using that pattern, instead of enabling the `PLATFORM_EC_RTC` we would need to add a `CROS_RTC_TYPE_NONE` in case that we don\u0027t want to have an RTC enabled. Is it better choice? I think that selecting the symbols is used only for buses in the upstream.",
      "parentUuid": "197e609c_bdd939ad",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 570,
        "startChar": 0,
